cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Relative Pixel Sensors
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A nervous system for a machine full of software. Recognizers identify what a
  thing is by its structure, probes extract single values, and declarative rules
  latch onto recognized kinds — accumulating into a decaying attention field that
  answers whether something wants attention before anything pays to find out what.
authors:
